# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything ignored here is derived. `img/` is NOT ignored: the site does not
# render without it, and it is the only image set that cannot be rebuilt from
# what is in the repo (see the note on _src below).
#
# Comments must sit on their own line — git treats a trailing "# ..." as part
# of the pattern, so an inline-commented rule silently matches nothing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw harvested originals, ~34 MB. Rebuild with:
#   powershell -File _qa/fetch-manifest.ps1 -Manifest _qa/wn-manifest.json
# Honest caveat: only the Wongnai manifest still re-fetches. The Instagram and
# Google URLs are signed and expire within days, so those sets have to be
# re-harvested from the live pages rather than replayed.
/_src/

# Artifact-sized re-encodes -> _qa/build-artifact-img.ps1
# (img/g/, the gallery thumbnails, is deliberately kept: a fresh clone should
#  render correctly without anyone having to run a script first.)
/_qa/aimg/

# Build output -> _qa/build-artifact.ps1
/_qa/rosebay-artifact.html

# QA captures and scratch pages, all regenerated by the scripts in _qa/
/_qa/shots/
/_qa/frame.html
/_qa/cells.html
/_qa/contact.html
/_qa/inspect.html
/_qa/caps.html
/_qa/menu.html
/_qa/gm.html
/_qa/gm2.html
/_qa/nojs.html

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
